{
  "voice": "成人男声｜老师清晰",
  "reference": "/Users/zhaozixu/Documents/Codex/2026-06-04/new-chat/work/full_voice_catalog/12-adult-male-teacher-clear.wav",
  "cfg_value": 1.35,
  "inference_timesteps": 12,
  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Has a person ever warmly held a door open for you?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "How do you feel after playing with friends?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "And what is your favourite family memory?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "These questions have one thing in common.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "They're all about connecting with people.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "'Let's Connect' is a theme of Children's Mental Health Week.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "It improves mental health by building healthy social connections.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Humans naturally connect with others.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "But it doesn't mean people should always feel that they are glued together.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Healthy connections give people energy and support.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "We all need people to share our worries with.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Social connections aren't just about mental health.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "They improve physical health too.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Research suggests being lonely can slowly harm your health.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "What's important is not how many relationships you have, but how good they are.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Then how can we connect with others?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "You can reach out and connect with people in many different ways.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "You can connect with your friends or parents by sharing a pizza or visiting the zoo together to see penguins, elephants, and other animals.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Organising a picnic with hamburgers or setting up a tent at a camping site can also be good ways to find shared adventures.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "It's not just people either.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Some people feel connected with their pets when spending time at the park.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-21.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "It is recommended to build more connections through actions as well as words.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-22.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "Listening to others and trying new experiences are good tools.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-23.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "Everybody may feel lonely sometimes and refuse to talk to others.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-24.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "But remember that there are always people that care for you.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-25.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "It's important to tell someone you trust about your feelings.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-26.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
